f6: lock-break evidence — our bot vs. the locker probe on the single-altar map
================================================================================

Instrument: cambc 4.0.0 / engine 2.0.0, --release, map 02treasure_box.
Team A = bots/vecticons (the F6 build, commit aed8ca5).
Team B = a throwaway probe bot that locks the altar nearest the enemy spawn
         (/tmp/opencode/f6probe/locker/src/bot.py — NOT in the repo).

Replay bundle: /tmp/opencode/f6probe/our-vs-locker/vecticons-vs-locker-1793360120073.repl26a
Extract: the "f6: lockbreak" and "s22: bank contest flag" lines of team-a.stdout.

